From e003889234dac111f1b90c3929ca3c6bd6c620b3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ewout van Mansom <ewout@vanmansom.name>
Date: Sat, 11 Apr 2026 09:12:45 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 5/6] common : add FC format validation reference for Gemma 4
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Add fc-format.h/.cpp with C++ functions matching LiteRT-LM's
fc_tool_format_utils pattern. Used as a validation reference in
tests to verify the Jinja template and PEG parser produce correct
Gemma 4 native format. Built only for test targets.

Generation: fc_format_tool_declaration() converts JSON Schema to
native declaration:name{...} format. fc_format_tool_response()
formats tool responses. fc_format_value() handles all value types.

Add validation tests: fc_format_value (all types), tool declaration,
tool call args, tool response, wrap helpers, and PEG parser
round-trip (fc_wrap_tool_call output → PEG parser → recovers
original JSON args).

Update Gemma 4 Jinja templates to latest upstream from HuggingFace.
Fix interleaved template test for reasoning_format=NONE behavior.
